ng?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=G85MkL346q0Q7kNvwELmROU&_nc_oc=AdnptKRpJPnTLJuX18Vyi93HJOhbkrpZLK_2DXSJSoT27piFeric5VPcznN1XpwMLb4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfybVAYJ746SV-OCLCSJltbZb9ji1t1FNLW7TB5Vmyqjig&oe=69BFE7D3"}, "display_name": "The Secret of Retropolis Demo", "keywords": [], "long_description": "The Secret of Retropolis is a VR narrative game of a new kind, a blend of classic point-and-click adventure with immersive cinematography. Embody the witty protagonist of a film noir plot. Meet unforgettable characters. Solve puzzles. Lose yourself in the retro-futuristic atmosphere.\n\nEXPERIENCE IN COMFORT.\nAs a seated experience with intuitive controls, first time VR users will find this game engaging and easy to play. Experienced VR users will find this game casual and relaxing.\n\nSTORY. ART. MUSIC.\nEnter a sprawling retro-futuristic cityscape with an original score, ensemble of voice actors and detailed hand drawn (in VR!) environments.\n\nGOOD \u2018OL ADVENTURE GAME\nBoot up that nostalgia for your favorite 90's point-and-click adventure games. Look around. Find items. Solve puzzles. Keep the past alive.\n\n\n* No robots were harmed in the making of this game.", "short_description": "The Secret of Retropolis is a VR narrative game of a new kind, a blend of classic point-and-click adventure with immersive cinematography. Embody the witty protagonist of a film noir plot. Meet unforgettable characters. Solve puzzles. Lose yourself in the retro-futuristic atmosphere."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://peanutbutton.net/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Peanut Button", "support_website_url": "http://peanutbutton.net/", "website_url": "http://peanutbutton.net/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ADVENTURE"